      "play\n\n### CSS Custom Properties (HSL, no hsl() wrapper — Tailwind adds it)\n--bg:",
      " 0 0% 4%;\n--surface: 0 0% 8%;\n--text: 0 0% 96%;\n--muted: 0 0% 53%;\n--stroke: 0 0",
