      "lugin-react, React 18.3.1, TypeScript 5.5.3\n- Tailwind CSS 3.4.1 via PostCSS + A",
      "utoprefixer\n- lucide-react 0.344.0\n- @supabase/supabase-js 2.57.4 (installed but",
      " unused in this page)\n- vite.config.ts: optimizeDeps.exclude includes 'lucide-re",
      "act'\n- tailwind.config.js: content array is ['./index.html', './src/**/*.{js,ts,",
