      "ckgroundImage to target image\n6. After another 30ms timeout: remove `pull-down` ",
      "class, set animatingRef false\n\nJSX structure (exact nesting):\n```\ndiv.hero\n  div",
      ".blur-overlay.blur-overlay-top\n  div.blur-overlay.blur-overlay-bottom\n  div.hero",
      "-bg-wrapper\n    div[ref=bgBackRef].hero-bg.bg-back\n    div[ref=bgFrontRef].hero-",
