      "rowser can play `application/vnd.apple.mpegurl` (Safari), set `video.src` direct",
      "ly\n3. Cleanup: `hls.destroy()` on unmount\n\nThe `<video>` element uses `autoPlay ",
      "loop muted playsInline` -- all four attributes are required for autoplay to work",
