      "mn has the eyebrow + h2 stacked. The right column has the body paragraph, aligne",
      "d to the bottom of the left column (`align-items: end`).\n\n---\n\n### Part 2: `.sec",
      "urity-card-grid` (3 cards in a row)\n\n```html\n<div class=\"security-card-grid\">\n  ",
