      "urity-api-visual,\n.compliance-list,\n.economics-visual {\n  position: relative;\n  ",
      "min-height: 300px;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Card 1: \"Full policy control\" (`.api-card`)\n\n",
      "```html\n<article class=\"security-card api-card\">\n  <div class=\"security-card-cop",
