      "  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 400;\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Card 3: \"Ownership and pr",
      "edictable economics\" (`.economics-card`)\n\n```html\n<article class=\"security-card ",
      "economics-card\">\n  <div class=\"security-card-copy\">\n    <h3>Ownership and predic",
      "table economics</h3>\n    <p>Reserved capacity, clear transfer lanes, and audit-r",
