      "letter-spacing: 0.035rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.asset-table strong {\n",
      "  color: rgba(255, 247, 222, 0.78);\n  text-transform: none;\n}\n```\n\nA minimal bor",
      "dered table with label/value columns. Labels are muted uppercase mono, values ar",
      "e brighter mono.\n\n---\n\n## Responsive Breakpoints\n\n### `@media (max-width: 820px)",
