      "erms\">Terms of Use</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n/",
      "/ === Hero Section ===\nconst navItems = [\"Company\", \"Technology\", \"Solutions\", \"",
      "Our Edge\", \"Our Team\", \"Investors\", \"News\"];\n\nclass EngineHero extends HTMLEleme",
      "nt {\n  scrollFrame = 0;\n  lastScrollY = 0;\n\n  connectedCallback() {\n    this.inn",
