      "2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n}\n\n.dashboard-row {\n  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.9fr 0.8",
      "fr;\n}\n\n.dashboard-row span:nth-child(4),\n.dashboard-row span:nth-child(5),\n.dash",
      "board-row strong {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.dashboard-toast {\n  position: static;\n  ",
      "width: auto;\n  margin: 24px;\n}\n```\n\nAt 820px: Heading stacks to single column. D",
      "ashboard sidebar moves to top with 2-column nav. Table hides columns 4 (Policy) ",
