      "-font-mono);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Part 2: `.pricing-plan-row` (3 plan cards)\n\n```html",
      "\n<div class=\"pricing-plan-row\">\n  <div class=\"pricing-plan starter\">\n    <h3>Sta",
      "rter</h3>\n    <p>For small teams consolidating shared project files.</p>\n    <a ",
