      "42px.\n- Mobile: `width: calc(100vw - 40px)`, `height: calc((100vw - 40px) * 2.05",
      ")`, border-radius 40px, border 6px. Notch shrinks to 100x24px. Inner content bor",
      "der-radius 34px.\n\n**Container layout:** `flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center ",
