      "fault=1&output=webp&url=https%3A%2F%2Fd8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net%2Fuser_38xzZb",
      "oKViGWJOttwIXH07lWA1P%2Fhf_20260707_111749_b8ced0e0-177c-4cca-9d14-b3fdd7bedf27.",
      "png&w=1920&q=85` | Label: `Field Cap ⊹` | Price: `$180`\n4. Image: `https://image",
      "s.higgs.ai/?default=1&output=webp&url=https%3A%2F%2Fd8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net",
      "%2Fuser_38xzZboKViGWJOttwIXH07lWA1P%2Fhf_20260707_111837_c28c966d-4a92-408f-8ac3",
      "-0c9bac445704.png&w=1920&q=85` | Label: `Summit Haul 40 ↟` | Price: `$540`\n\n**Ca",
      "rd image styling**: `width: 140%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; margin-left: ",
